doc/figures/ - independently editable figure units
=================================================

Each NAME/ has two sources:
    diagram.tex   TikZ/pgfplots geometry and drawing labels
    figure.tex    complete figure float, scaling, caption and reference label

The report and the cropped preview include the same figure.tex, so previews
exercise the actual caption, dimensions and shared fonts/styles. No duplicate
standalone source or manually rendered image is maintained. Shared drawing
styles remain in ../config/{tikz,colors,macros}.tex.

    pe/           ALU, result/accumulator feedback and reset
    array/        default 4x4 bidirectional mesh and edge operands
    fsm/          grouped command phases, shared receiver/step engine
    systolic/     chronological product delay and final snapshot
    stack/        host/device software stack
    timing/       reset guard and enabled capture edges
    exec/         v2/v3 request/reply sequence
    cost/         wire-cost ratios from the archived CSV

From the repository root:
    make -C doc -f doc.mk figure-pe
    make -C doc -f doc.mk -j4 figures
    pdftoppm -singlefile -png -r 160 doc/build/previews/figure/pe/preview.pdf /tmp/cgra-pe

Inspect the preview after changing coordinates, routes or label placement.
Then make doc checks floats and references in the complete report. A float
preview uses local figure numbering and cached full-report reference numbers.
See ../STRUCTURE.md and ../AGENTS.md for the complete editing workflow.
